@ 29.1.1.1.15 - Proto-Athabaskan to Upper Koyukon
# citation: Whimemsz, from Krauss, Michael and Victor Golla (1981), “Northern Athapaskan Languages”. Handbook of North American Indians, Vol. 6 (Subarctic), 67 – 85
	e a ɑ ʊ → a o ŏ ŭ
	TS {TŠ,TŠʷ} → TŁ TS
	# Stem-final/suffixal consonant clusters lost in Minchumina-Bearpaw Upper Koyukon
	K → TŠ
	C’ → C / _$
	Vˀ → V[+low tone] → V[-tone]
	w → m / _Vn
	w → b